{"title": "Dazing Smite", "pageid": 27996, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dazing_Smite", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Dazing Smite</b> is a passive feature that dazzles targets you hit with a Smite.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>On a hit infused with one of your <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\">Smites</a>, the target must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Constitution Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dazed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\">Dazed</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Dazed\"> Condition: Dazed </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dazed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\">Dazed</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;13)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;13)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>, can't take <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a>, and loses the <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> bonus to their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>.</li>\n<li>Removed if an ally <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Helps</a> this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blackguard%27s_Sword\" title=\"Blackguard's Sword\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Blackguard%27s_Sword_Item_Icon.png/30px-Blackguard%27s_Sword_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Blackguard%27s_Sword_Item_Icon.png/45px-Blackguard%27s_Sword_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Blackguard%27s_Sword_Item_Icon.png/60px-Blackguard%27s_Sword_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Blackguard%27s_Sword_Item_Icon.png/30px-Blackguard%27s_Sword_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Blackguard%27s_Sword_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Blackguard%27s_Sword\" title=\"Blackguard's Sword\">Blackguard's Sword</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Guards\" title=\"That Which Guards\">That Which Guards</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Dazing Smite will activate when used with the ranged variants of smites when attacking with a ranged weapon.</li>\n<li>Dazing Smite requires damage to be dealt when attacking with a smite spell, and not simply for a hit to occur.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Dazing Smite will not activate when used with the following smites:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite_(Melee)\" title=\"Banishing Smite (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/38px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/50px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banishing Smite (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite_(Melee)\" title=\"Banishing Smite (Melee)\">Banishing Smite (Melee)</a> when cast at level 6</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinding_Smite\" title=\"Blinding Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/38px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/50px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinding Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinding_Smite\" title=\"Blinding Smite\">Blinding Smite</a> when cast at level 4, 5, and 6</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Branding_Smite_(Ranged)\" title=\"Branding Smite (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Branding_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp/25px-Branding_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Branding_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp/38px-Branding_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Branding_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp/50px-Branding_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Branding Smite (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Branding_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp/25px-Branding_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Branding_Smite_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Branding_Smite_(Ranged)\" title=\"Branding Smite (Ranged)\">Branding Smite (Ranged)</a> when cast at level 4, 5, and 6</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite_(reaction)\" title=\"Divine Smite (reaction)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/38px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/50px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Smite (reaction)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite_(reaction)\" title=\"Divine Smite (reaction)\">Divine Smite (reaction)</a> when cast as an interrupt to a non-smite attack (including the smites mentioned in this list)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staggering_Smite\" title=\"Staggering Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/38px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/50px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Staggering Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/25px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Staggering_Smite\" title=\"Staggering Smite\">Staggering Smite</a> when cast at level 5 and 6</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200748\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2921/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30739/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10369/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 154/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 879824/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   67.380      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   67.380      1 -total\n 31.14%   20.979      9 Template:Icon_text\n 27.10%   18.260     27 Template:Trim\n 21.58%   14.538      1 Template:Condition\n 18.07%   12.176      7 Template:Icon_link\n 18.04%   12.153      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 16.13%   10.869     11 Template:Ifempty\n 13.50%    9.093      5 Template:SAI\n 13.37%    9.011      1 Template:SavingThrow\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27996-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200748 and revision id 371511. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}